tato\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-piggy-bank\"><path d=\"M19 5c-1.5 0-2.8 1.4-3 2-3.5-1.5-11-.3-11 5 0 1.8 0 3 2 4.5V20h4v-2h3v2h4v-4c1-.5 1.7-1 2-2h2v-4h-2c0-1-.5-1.5-1-2V5z\"></path><path d=\"M2 9v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h1\"></path><path d=\"M16 11h.01\"></path></svg><span>Abertura de conta</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#contato\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock-keyhole\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1\"></circle><rect x=\"3\" y=\"10\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 10V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3\"></path></svg><span>Segurança</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#contato\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-receipt-text\"><path d=\"M4 2v20l2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1V2l-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 8H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 12H8\"></path><path d=\"M13 16H8\"></path></svg><span>Documentos</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"campaign-banner banner-blue \" data-cm-section=\"original-1\"><div class=\"campaign-photo\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.221533px);\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/help-campaign-relatable-v2.webp.webp\" alt=\"Especialista de atendimento conversando com uma cliente em um ambiente acolhedor\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"eager\" data-cm-image=\"true\"></div><div class=\"campaign-copy\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.221533px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow light\"><span></span> GENTE QUE ESCUTA</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Atendimento claro.<br>Próximo passo simples.</h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Comece pelo assunto e encontre a orientação certa para continuar com segurança.</p><a class=\"button button-light\" href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\">Falar com a equipe<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"campaign-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C+</div></div></section><section class=\"section contact-panel\" id=\"contato\" data-cm-section=\"original-2\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.304782px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow dark\"><span></span> FALE COM A CREDMAISPAY</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Conte o que você precisa.</h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Como os canais oficiais ainda serão confirmados, este formulário funciona como uma prévia visual e não envia dados.</p></div><div class=\"contact-form\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(1.15125px);\"><div class=\"form-grid\"><label>Nome<input name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"Ex.: Maria Silva\"></label><label>Telefone<input name=\"phone\" autocomplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"Ex.: (11) 99999-9999\" inputmode=\"tel\" type=\"tel\"></label><label class=\"full\">Assunto<select name=\"subject\" autocomplete=\"off\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Selecione uma opção</option><option>Abertura de conta</option><option>Conta digital</option><option>Empréstimos e microcrédito</option><option>Pix</option><option>Segurança</option></select></label><label class=\"full\">Mensagem<textarea name=\"message\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Conte um pouco sobre o que você precisa…\" rows=\"4\"></textarea></label></div><button class=\"button button-dark\" type=\"button\">Visualizar interesse<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button><p class=\"form-note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p></div></section><section class=\"section faq-section compact\" data-cm-section=\"original-3\"><div class=\"faq-intro\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.477472px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow dark\"><span></span> PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Respostas rápidas</h2></div><div class=\"faq-support\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(1.63786px);\"><span class=\"faq-support-mark\">?</span><div><b>Ainda ficou com dúvida?</b><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Fale com a equipe e encontre o próximo passo para o seu momento.</p><a href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\">Falar com a equipe <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-list\"><details open=\"\"><summary><span>01</span>O que é a CredMaisPay?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p>A CredMaisPay reúne soluções financeiras digitais para pessoas físicas. A disponibilidade de cada produto será apresentada no momento da contratação.</p></details><details><summary><span>02</span>Como acompanho minha movimentação?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p>A proposta é concentrar saldo, pagamentos, Pix e notificações em uma única experiência digital.</p></details><details><summary><span>03</span>Quais recursos estarão disponíveis?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p>Conta, Pix, pagamentos e possibilidades de microcrédito fazem parte da experiência apresentada. Condições e elegibilidade variam por produto.</p></details><details><summary><span>04</span>Como falar com a equipe?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p>Use a página de ajuda para registrar seu interesse ou encontrar o canal adequado.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"closing-cta\" data-cm-section=\"original-4\"><div class=\"cta-orb orb-a\"></div><div class=\"cta-orb orb-b\"></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.7136px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow light\"><span></span> CENTRAL DE AJUDA</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Encontre o caminho.<br><em>para resolver.</em></h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Comece pelo assunto e receba orientação para dar o próximo passo.</p><a class=\"button button-gold\" href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\">Falar com atendimento <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-lead\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow light\"><span></span> #sejaCREDMAISpay</p><h2>Mais clareza para<br><em>seguir em frente.</em></h2></div><div><p>Conta, Pix e microcrédito para quem trabalha, empreende e faz a vida acontecer.</p><a class=\"button button-gold\" href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\">Falar com a gente <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"brand brand-light\" translate=\"no\" href=\"/\" data-discover=\"true\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/brand/credmaispay-symbol.svg